    "raw": "# Groom musicology tags \u2192 runtime tagging\n\n## Status (2026-07-18)\n\n**Phase 1 (maps / schema): done.** Artifacts under `skills/groom-musicology-tags/`:\ninventory TSVs, VFAT-safe `type;value` schema, per-provider synonym maps,\n`extraction-paths.md`, scan/build scripts.\n\n**Phase 2 (mechanistic apply): implemented on this branch (uncommitted code until\nyou commit).** `postingest` now: musicscan \u2192 `.meta.combined.json` (synonym-\nnormalized) \u2192 `importtags` \u2192 `refresh-extracted-tags`. `importtags` reads\n**only** `.meta.combined.json`.\n\nJunk nested albums: script `shadup/fix-junk-nested-albums.sh` removes Cohen/\nPixies duplicates (top-level already present). Leaves Placebo/`VA - Meds` and\nSquirrel Nut/`MEDIA`. Needs a TTY sudo remount to run.\n\n## How to run\n\nPATH should include `utils/binlinks` (and usually `bin/binlinks` for\n`musicscan` / `with-ro-remounted-rw.sh`).\n\n### 1. Ingest new audio into the store\n\n```bash\n# Each arg is one album dir (basename \u2192 files/<basename>/). Remounts sdb2 rw.\ningest /path/to/public/SomeAlbum\n# or many:\ningest /path/to/public/AlbumA /path/to/public/AlbumB\n```\n\nDo **not** pass the parent `public/` folder. Sources are removed after success.\n\n### 2. Post-ingest (musicology + tags + _tags mirror)\n\n```bash\n# Full tree (default root: /mnt/sdb2/music/flac/files):\npostingest\n\n# One album or multi-CD box (CD1/CD2/CD3 + parent union):\npostingest \"/mnt/sdb2/music/flac/files/Some Album\"\n\n# Force rebuild combined + rescan providers:\npostingest --force \"/mnt/sdb2/music/flac/files/Some Album\"\n\n# Dry-run (no writes; no remount needed if POSTINGEST_NO_REMOUNT=1):\nPOSTINGEST_NO_REMOUNT=1 postingest --dry-run --skip-import /path/to/album\n```\n\nWorking providers = musicbrainz + discogs/lastfm when creds are in the\nenvironment (`DISCOGS_*`, `LASTFM_API_KEY`). Override with\n`POSTINGEST_PROVIDERS=musicbrainz,discogs` or `--provider`.\n\nEmpty / unmatched provider results are OK (empty sidecar stub). No hard fail.\n\n### 3. Optional: refresh synonym maps (when corpus drifts)\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/groom-musicology-tags/scripts/scan_inventory.py \\\n  /mnt/sdb2/music/flac/files \\\n  --out skills/groom-musicology-tags/inventory\npython3 skills/groom-musicology-tags/scripts/build_synonym_maps.py\n# review synonyms/*.json dropped + map, then re-run postingest --force as needed\n```\n\n### 4. Optional: fix junk nests (once, needs sudo remount)\n\n```bash\nwith-ro-remounted-rw.sh ~/github.com/jovlinger/utils/shadup/fix-junk-nested-albums.sh\n```\n\n## Remaining / follow-ups (not blocking the maps AC)\n\n1. **Commit** the postingest/importtags/meta_combine changes on this branch (still dirty in the worktree).\n2. **Run** `fix-junk-nested-albums.sh` under remount (sudo TTY).\n3. **Smoke** `postingest --force` on one known album + one multi-CD box; confirm `.meta.combined.json` and `_tags`.\n4. First full-library `postingest --force` will hit APIs (rate limits / time); prefer batched roots.\n5. Box parents with **no audio** get a combined file but `importtags` skips DB attach (no store target)\u2014expected.\n"
  },
